# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tamil Accessible TTS: never commit audio, models, checkpoints, local data,
# caches or credentials (see CLAUDE.md and docs/PRD.md §2, §6, §7).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local-only workspace (PRD §6)
.local/

# Audio: TAM recordings, reference prompts, generated speech
